  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Chop cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets. <br>• Slice brown onion (see ingredients) into wedges.<br>• Place cauliflower and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and  <br>season with salt. Toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender, 20-25 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69311a957558b9c7de4dcc47/step-0d099700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, boil the kettle. <br>• Finely chop or crush garlic.<br>• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water.<br>• Cook fusilli in boiling water over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 11 mins.<br>• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P), then drain.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69311a957558b9c7de4dcc47/step-547e9d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When veggies are done, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with the butter and a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook tomato &amp; herb seasoning, garlic and the plain flour until fragrant, 1 min.<br>• Stir in cooking cream, the stock powder, milk and reserved pasta water. Simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 mins.<br>• Add cooked pasta, roast veggies and baby spinach, stirring to combine.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69311a957558b9c7de4dcc47/step-081e5220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat grill to high.<br>• Transfer pasta mixture to a baking dish. <br>• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Grill until golden, 5-10 mins.<br>• Divide cheesy cauliflower pasta bake between bowls. <br>• Sprinkle with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69311a957558b9c7de4dcc47/step-7feee030.jpg"
    }
  ]
